  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"Qr1qd\" id=\"Qr1qd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua804277d\" id=\"ua804277d\">输出</span></h1><ul list=\"ud52f6170\"><li fid=\"u40b5bbe5\" data-lake-id=\"u434a5380\" id=\"u434a5380\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7bfe28dc\" id=\"u7bfe28dc\">输出：将程序的运行结果输出到控制台或终端窗口中</span></li><li fid=\"u40b5bbe5\" data-lake-id=\"uef70f7ce\" id=\"uef70f7ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u253542a1\" id=\"u253542a1\">printf语法格式</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22int%20printf%20(const%20char%20*format%2C%20...)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22__widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BmA1R%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22widthMode%22%3A%22normal%22%7D\" hindent=\"2em\" data-comment-id=\"40504677\"></card><ul list=\"u69bdde5f\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf235107b\" data-lake-id=\"ub3463235\" id=\"ub3463235\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff64ca20\" id=\"uff64ca20\">format参数是一个格式化字符串，包含了输出的格式控制信息</span></li><li fid=\"uf235107b\" data-lake-id=\"u20a9cb99\" id=\"u20a9cb99\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7d13af6e\" id=\"u7d13af6e\">后面的参数</span><code data-lake-id=\"u64dfa346\" id=\"u64dfa346\"><span data-lake-id=\"u82e8bf82\" id=\"u82e8bf82\">...</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u86566d47\" id=\"u86566d47\">是可变参数，参数(要输出的数据)长度不固定</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u69bdde5f\"><li fid=\"uf235107b\" data-lake-id=\"u6f9ce14c\" id=\"u6f9ce14